feature: events
description: Event ingestion, validation, deduplication, custom enrichment, and ingestion to Kafka backbone.
dependencies:
  - shared/config
  - shared/constants
  - infra/adapters/kafka
  - infra/adapters/redis
decisions:
  - validation: Use jsonparser for field validation to avoid full payload deserialization CPU overhead.
  - dedup: SetNX in Redis to guarantee at-least-once edge deduplication.
  - wire_format: Avro wire format with Confluent schema header for smaller payload size and schema registry safety.
  - tracing: W3C Trace Context propagation injected into Kafka record headers for distributed correlation.
criticality: High. Entry point for all edge event data. Low CPU overhead and high availability are critical.
